#: ../../chapter10.rst:3
msgid "Branding"
msgstr "Branding"

#: ../../chapter10.rst:5
msgid ""
"You can brand the web portal, Windows and Mac clients, iOS and Android "
"Applications."
msgstr "Du kan brande webportalen, Windows- og Mac-klienter, iOS- og Android-applikationer."

#: ../../chapter10.rst:8
msgid "Self-Service Branding"
msgstr "Self-Service Branding"

#: ../../chapter10.rst:10
msgid ""
"The self-service branding starts with the \"Cluster Manager\". In order "
"to start the branding, you will login to the web portal as the Cluster "
"Administrator."
msgstr "Selvbetjening af branding starter med \"Cluster Manager\". For at starte branding, vil du logge ind på webportalen som Cluster Administrator."

#: ../../chapter10.rst:13
msgid ""
"After you login to the web portal, click to the \"Cluster Branding\" "
"Pages."
msgstr "Efter du logger ind på webportalen, klik på \"Cluster Branding\" siderne."

#: ../../chapter10.rst:17
msgid ""
"Please reference the \"Branding\" section in the `Admin Guide`__ for the "
"self-hosted |prodname| server."
msgstr "Henvis venligst til \"Branding\" afsnittet i `Admin Guide`__ for den selvhostede |prodname| server."

